        "name": "USN-7545-2",
        "description": "USN-7545-1 fixed a vulnerability in Apport. The update introduced a regression that prevented core dumps from being generated inside containers. This update fixes the problem.  We apologize for the inconvenience.  Original advisory details:   Qualys discovered that Apport incorrectly handled metadata when  processing application crashes. An attacker could possibly use this issue  to leak sensitive information.",
